- the ACE read path: the customer facts are read only through the rwb-source-data contract, never from a `v_ace_*` view or an ACE table; the party-flag, deceased-marker and freshness fields are to be confirmed with P1 before the wave 2 system test, and the boundary test fails the build on any view read or ACE table read;
- the screening read: the evidence pack through the rwb-document contract and the call notes as a field of the rwb-source-data contract, with no copy of a document held in schema rwb_deviation, both confirmed with their owners before the shadow screening test;
